---
// The copy confirmation. Base.astro's script writes the message and toggles .show.
---

<div
  id="toast"
  role="status"
  aria-live="polite"
  class="pointer-events-none fixed bottom-7 left-1/2 z-90 -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-[10px] rounded-full border border-bf-lime/45 bg-bf-border-muted/92 px-4 py-[0.6rem] font-code text-[0.78rem] text-bf-lime opacity-0 backdrop-blur-[12px] transition-[opacity,translate] duration-250 [&.show]:translate-y-0 [&.show]:opacity-100"
>
</div>
